msgstr "启用系统辨识功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:24
#: 3ffbcef507744fb1bb8b3a1dae7dd165
msgid ""
"This feature is not automatically compiled into the stable version of "
"firmware.  Use the `custom firmware webtool "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__ to compile a version for your board. "
"Select the \"system ID support for quadplanes\" under the Plane category."
msgstr ""
"此功能未自动编译进稳定版固件。使用 `自定义固件网页工具 <https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__ 为您的飞控板编译版本。在 "
"Plane 类别下选择「quadplane 的系统 ID 支持」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:27
#: fe85bf9511b9442dadaf3b9865b16aa9
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:29
#: e948693cdcc9498c8813745b1413e1e4
msgid ""
"System ID feature in quadplane is different than copter.  The system ID "
"feature in copter is a separate flight mode.  In quadplane, system ID is run"
" on top of either qstabilize, qhover, or qloiter flight modes.  The system "
"ID feature is started and stopped using an Aux Switch."
msgstr ""
"QuadPlane 中的系统 ID 功能与 Copter 不同。Copter 中的系统 ID 功能是单独的飞行模式，而在 QuadPlane 中，系统 "
"ID 运行在 QStabilize、QHover 或 QLoiter 飞行模式之上。系统 ID 功能通过辅助开关启动和停止。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:31
#: fb6d9412970f40e3aa2f68e5241df092
msgid ""
"Set an aux switch on the transmitter to have ``RCx_OPTION`` set to 184 to "
"start/stop operation."
msgstr "将遥控器上的辅助开关设置 ``RCx_OPTION`` = 184 以启动/停止操作。"
